10:     bc is a language that supports arbitrary precision numbers with
11:     interactive execution of statements.  There are some similarities in the
12:     syntax to the C programming language.  A standard math library is
13:     available by command line option.  If requested, the math library is
14:     defined before processing any files.  bc starts by processing code from
