347-     if ( expression ) statement1 [else statement2]
348-            The if statement evaluates the expression and executes statement1
349-            or statement2 depending on the value of the expression.  If the
350-            expression is non-zero, statement1 is executed.  If statement2 is
351-            present and the value of the expression is 0, then statement2 is
352-            executed.  (The else clause is an extension.)
353-
354-     while ( expression ) statement
