637-
638-     last   POSIX bc does not have a last variable.  Some implementations of
639-            bc use the period (.) in a similar way.
640-
641-     comparisons
642-            POSIX bc allows comparisons only in the if statement, the while
643-            statement, and the second expression of the for statement.  Also,
644-            only one relational operation is allowed in each of those
645-            statements.
646-
